'''''Gymnosporia cassinoides''''' is a species of [[flowering plant]] in the family [[Celastraceae]]. It is a [[Conservation-dependent species|conservation-dependent]] shrub or tree [[Endemism|endemic]] to the [[Canary Islands]].

